  "claim": "The Chaos Emeralds disappeared in \"Sonic Chronicles\" after the defeat of the main antagonist of the game.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Sonic Chronicles: The Dark Brotherhood. Sentence: \"Sonic Chronicles\" initially focuses on the events surrounding the kidnapping of Knuckles and the disappearance of the Chaos Emeralds after the defeat of Doctor Eggman, before moving on to follow the cast of characters across two dimensions as they encounter a new ally, Shade the Echidna, and seek to stop the invasion of their world by Ix, the leader of Shade's tribe, the Nocturnus.\nPage: Doctor Eggman. Sentence: Dr. Ivo \"Eggman\" Robotnik (ドクター・エッグマン , Dokutā Egguman , ロボトニック \"Robotonikku\") is a fictional character and the main antagonist of Sega's \"Sonic the Hedgehog\" series.",
